# Orderz House Flutter — Staging QA (NO SECRETS)
# Copy values into a local override or pass via --dart-define.
# Do NOT commit real credentials. Do NOT point QA builds at Production
# unless you intentionally accept Production risk.
#
# Backend: run with Staging Neon only, e.g.
#   cd backend && npm run start:staging   (or your staging start script)
# Frontend web handoff (optional): CLIENT_URL often http://localhost:5174 in staging.
#
# Android emulator → host machine:
API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:5000/api
WEB_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:5174
#
# Physical device on same Wi‑Fi (replace IP):
# API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.x.x:5000/api
# WEB_BASE_URL=http://192.168.x.x:5174
#
# Build debug APK baked to Staging:
# flutter build apk --debug ^
#   --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:5000/api ^
#   --dart-define=WEB_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:5174
#
# Or run:
# flutter run --dart-define-from-file=.env.staging.example
